http-signature includes conformance behavior derived from RFC 9421 and RFC
9530, published by the IETF Trust. Source identities and checksums are recorded
in spec/sources.lock.json. RFC code components are subject to the Revised BSD
License terms described by the IETF Trust Legal Provisions.

The module depends on github.com/dunglas/httpsfv for RFC 8941 Structured Fields
parsing and serialization. See go.mod and the dependency's license for details.

The ECDSA P-384 test corpus includes a verification vector from the NIST CAVP
FIPS 186-3 archive pinned in spec/sources.lock.json.
